  "events": [
    {
      "text": "I’m painting an imagined brass plumb bob against blue plaster, sparked by a Smithsonian surveyor’s tool. I’ll see whether a broad shadow plane and one short highlight can give the bob weight. https://americanhistory.si.edu/collections/object/nmah_1815965",
      "kind": "try",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 8580,
      "afterStroke": 0
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 4
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 4
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "The first blue passes dried into horizontal bands. I’ll cross them with softer diagonal washes and let the wall shadow lean away from the hanging weight.",
      "kind": "try",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 6760,
      "afterStroke": 4
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "The offset shadow goes soft at its foot. I’m setting the brass in front with overlapping dark ochre passes, from the shoulders down to the point.",
      "kind": "try",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 6760,
      "afterStroke": 8
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "The overlapping marks filled the weight, but the shoulder is still round like a drop. A dark cap and a flatter shoulder will give it a machined shape.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 7280,
      "afterStroke": 12
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "The darker right face holds from across the room. The point hangs beneath the cap, so I’ll bring one taut cord down to that axis and give its shadow a little room.",
      "kind": "try",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 8320,
      "afterStroke": 16
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 20
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 20
    },
    {
      "text": "The cord makes the weight read as suspended. I’ll warm the upper left and add a narrow seam beneath the cap so the brass reads as turned metal.",
      "kind": "try",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 7280,
      "afterStroke": 20
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 24
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 24
    },
    {
      "text": "The shoulder seam reads, but its center is too dark. I’ll soften that section and give the shadow side a cooler reflected edge.",
      "kind": "try",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 6000,
      "afterStroke": 24
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 28
    },
    {
      "text": "The warmer pass shortened the dark seam, and the tip looks cooler than the body. The blue still has bright stripes, so I’ll add a few broader washes away from the metal.",
      "kind": "try",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 8320,
      "afterStroke": 28
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 32
    },
    {
      "text": "The diagonal washes broke the brightest bands near the sides. I’ll make a narrower golden plane inside the left edge, where the highlight will have a warm middle value to turn into.",
      "kind": "try",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 8320,
      "afterStroke": 32
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 36
    },
    {
      "text": "The narrow gold follows the flank and leaves the point subdued. I’ll try one pale reflection near the shoulder and check it on its own.",
      "kind": "try",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 6500,
      "afterStroke": 36
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 37
    },
    {
      "text": "The pale mark survives at whole view without filling the flank. I’ll give the wall two faint construction marks and make the cast shadow taper like the weight.",
      "kind": "try",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 7280,
      "afterStroke": 37
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 41
    },
    {
      "text": "The pencil marks almost disappear. I’m looking lower to judge the distance from the steel point to the wall marks and the falloff of its shadow.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.75
      },
      "duration": 6760,
      "afterStroke": 41
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.7493455497382199
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 41
    },
    {
      "text": "In the lower view, the first pencil marks vanish into the wall. I’ll put a short witness mark directly below the tip, with enough air between them for the bob to hang free.",
      "kind": "try",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.7493455497382199
      },
      "duration": 8580,
      "afterStroke": 41
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 45
    },
    {
      "text": "The witness mark sits under the point, but its middle looks like a fleck. I’ll extend two quieter arms and put a restrained warm edge along the upper shoulder.",
      "kind": "try",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 7540,
      "afterStroke": 45
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 49
    },
    {
      "text": "The line, point, and wall mark now share an axis. The short light still holds beside the broad brown shadow. Blue bands and bristle ridges remain visible, and the wall mark stays rough. I’m keeping those edges and stopping here.",
      "kind": "keep",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 10400,
      "afterStroke": 49
    },
